OL,3,ABadenoch says proposed #10bn air
OL,4,Adefence system would be 'specific' to
OL,5,AUK threats as costs questioned
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch tells the BBC the
OL,8,FConservatives would aim to do "what
OL,9,Fother European countries are doing" and
OL,10,F- if elected - design an air defence
OL,11,Fsystem "specific for the kind of
OL,12,Fthreat" the UK faces
OL,14,FIt comes after her party said it wanted
OL,15,Fto create a #10bn system named
OL,16,F"Britannia Shield" - saying it was "in
OL,17,Fessence a British 'Iron Dome'"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
