OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABadenoch says proposed #10bn air
OL,4,Adefence system would be 'specific' to
OL,5,AUK threats as costs questioned
OL,6,
OL,7,FBadenoch told BBC Breakfast the
OL,8,Fprogramme could be paid for with #1bn
OL,9,Fearmarked every year for a decade, and
OL,10,Fpointed to her party having already set
OL,11,Fout savings in areas such as welfare
OL,12,Fand net zero
OL,14,FLater, on Radio 4's Today programme,
OL,15,FBadenoch was asked if promises the
OL,16,FTories had made defence and tax were
OL,17,F"fiscally responsible" - to which she
OL,18,Fsaid her party wasn't "messing around"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
