OL,3,ABadenoch says proposed #10bn air
OL,4,Adefence system would be 'specific' to
OL,5,AUK threats as costs questioned
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe also spoke about Reform voters,
OL,8,Fsaying she wants them to vote
OL,9,FConservative again, but added that the
OL,10,Fparty's politicians are "just not our
OL,11,Fkind of people"
OL,13,FThe Conservative leader was speaking
OL,14,Ffrom the party's annual conference in
OL,15,FBirmingham - she is due to give her
OL,16,Fkeynote speech on Wednesday
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
